# PWA rule

Canonical detail: **`docs/architecture/pwa.md`**. Skill: **`.agent/skills/pwa/SKILL.md`**.

## Service worker

- **`src/service-worker.ts` is worker-only** — never import `$lib/server/*` or DOM modules. Shared constants live in **`src/lib/pwa/shared.ts`**.
- **No default fetch handler for POST/PUT/DELETE** — only intercept non-GET when offline (503 JSON). Online mutations pass through.
- Registration is manual via **`src/lib/pwa/register.ts`** with `kit.serviceWorker.register = false`. Never auto-reload; use **`UpdatePrompt`**.

## Offline cache allowlist

- **`OFFLINE_API_READS` in `shared.ts` is canonical.** Adding a root caches borrower/investor PII on disk, unencrypted at rest.
- **`normalizeDataCacheKey`** must strip `x-sveltekit-invalidated` for `__data.json` cache keys.

## Identity isolation

- Cache names are `kl-*`. **`purgeOfflineState()`** wipes `kl-pages` and `kl-data` on sign-out and account switch.
- Update purge when adding new per-viewer offline stores.

## Push

- Subscriptions in **`push_subscriptions`**; dedupe via **`push_notification_log`** (`onConflictDoNothing` before send).
- **`enablePush()`** requires a user gesture. Hide device opt-in on iOS until installed (`needsInstallFirst`).
- New notification kinds need a preference flag and a documented trigger path.

## Precache budget

- **`scripts/pwa/precache-budget.json`** is enforced by CI after `build`. Fix size by code-splitting, not by raising the budget blindly.

## Kill-switch

- **`/api/pwa/version`** returns `{ disabled, minVersion }` with `cache-control: no-store`. SW checks must not self-destruct on fetch failure.
